    "updated_at": "2017-03-21T05:46:27Z",
    "body": "I think \"For all integer values of x and y where dirtyX ≤ x < dirtyX+dirtyWidth and dirtyY ≤ y < dirtyY+dirtyHeight\" (last step of `putImageData()`) needs to be changed as well since dirtyX and dirtyY no longer need ≤ they can just be equal now. In fact, if we update that the \"The following must result in no visible changes to the rendering\" requirement can be turned into a statement of fact or a note I think, but I'm not a 100% sure.",
