    "created_at": "2017-03-21T18:48:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-03-21T18:48:31Z",
    "body": "> In fact, if we update that the \"The following must result in no visible changes to the rendering\" requirement can be turned into a statement of fact or a note I think, but I'm not a 100% sure.\r\n\r\nI think we could just get rid of it. I don't see the value that is added by this chunk of spec.  Perhaps in the past, when hi-res backings were a thing, this statement was not such an obvious tautology?",
